WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
and what is Cashea, right in front.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.590
At the AlegrIA hackathon, organized by Cashea and Yummy,

3
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.420
we had an online talk with Pedro Vallenilla,

4
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.000
Cashea's cofounder.

5
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.840
Months later he came to Barquisimeto in person to give

6
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:19.720
an improved and much fuller talk with Father Elías

7
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:20.900
Sayegh.

8
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.720
We were literally in the second row of the theater.

9
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:31.140
So, he told us how several of his startups failed before

10
00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.320
the huge success that was Cashea.

11
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:41.160
And how he kept going and going until he built Cashea.

12
00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:46.210
What stayed with me the most was the way he talks about

13
00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.440
Venezuela.

14
00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:53.080
And is that after everything it has been through,

15
00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:58.160
it's a green field for building anything because here

16
00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.100
there are no tech driven solutions that other countries

17
00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.120
already have yet.

18
00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:09.520
And that's why Venezuela is at the best moment to start

19
00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.710
a startup or a company and not in theory,

20
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.238
but in practice.
